findings.citation_text:
750.1160 - Evidence of rodent activity was observed. Mouse droppings were observed along floors and surfaces in the following locations:
A) chicken prep area;
B) HVAC/electrical panel room adjacent to chicken prep area;
C) storage room past restrooms;
D) mop closet;  and
E) manager's office/dry storage room - gnawed paper was also observed on the floor under shelving against the wall.
Call for service was made to pest control operator (PCO). A thorough cleaning is needed in all of the abovementioned areas in addition to treatment from the PCO.
GM and staff began cleaning in the manager's office/dry storage room during the inspection.

Effective measures to minimize the presence of rodents and insects shall be utilized. Provide effective pest control.

